{"seq":3,"slug":"commission-structure","title":"佣金结构：固定、比例与阶梯","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/affiliate-partner-marketing/affiliate-model/commission-structure","wordCount":2202,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"佣金结构-固定-比例与阶梯\">佣金结构：固定、比例与阶梯</h1><p>一个商品售价 199 元、成本 110 元、运费 18 元，商家愿意为这笔成交付出多少佣金？如果按 GMV 的 15% 算，是 29.85 元；如果按扣除运费后的净额算，是 27.15 元；如果按毛利算，是 10.65 元。三个都是&quot;15% 佣金&quot;，但它们对商家的实际含义差了三倍。<strong>佣金结构的第一个决定不是费率高低，而是计佣基数</strong>——这一条定错，后面所有的费率谈判都建立在一个虚假的数字上。</p>\n<p>本篇只讲钱怎么定义。四大角色谁付谁收见 <a href=\"affiliate-network-roles\">广告主/联盟客/联盟网络角色</a>；佣金怎么结算、怎么被退货扣回见第四章 <a href=\"../settlement-fraud/affiliate-settlement\">佣金结算与退货扣回</a>；达人专属码与专属费率见 <a href=\"../kol-offsite/kol-affiliate-program\">达人联盟计划与素材分发</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-三层结构-基数-费率-形态\">核心概念：三层结构——基数、费率、形态</h2><p>佣金金额的通用公式可以写成：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>commission</mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>rate</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>context</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>×</mo><mtext>base</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>order</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mtext>deductions</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>bonus</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>period</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{commission} = \\text{rate}(\\text{context}) \\times \\text{base}(\\text{order}) - \\text{deductions} + \\text{bonus}(\\text{period})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6679em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">commission</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">rate</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">context</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">base</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">order</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">deductions</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">bonus</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">period</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>三个部分各有独立的工程问题：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>base</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{base}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">base</span></span></span></span></span></span> 是<strong>计佣基数</strong>，从订单里取哪些金额字段；</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>rate</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{rate}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">rate</span></span></span></span></span></span> 是<strong>费率</strong>，它是 <code>context</code> 的函数——同一个订单对不同的联盟客、不同的品类、不同的市场，费率可能不同；</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>bonus</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{bonus}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">bonus</span></span></span></span></span></span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>deductions</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{deductions}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">deductions</span></span></span></span></span></span> 是<strong>周期性的调整项</strong>，与单笔订单无关，属于结算期维度。</li>\n</ul>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[订单事件] --&gt; B[确定计佣基数 base]&#10;  B --&gt; C{取哪些金额}&#10;  C --&gt; D[GMV 含运费]&#10;  C --&gt; E[净销售额 扣运费/税]&#10;  C --&gt; F[毛利口径]&#10;  B --&gt; G[解析费率上下文 context]&#10;  G --&gt; H[广告主程序]&#10;  G --&gt; I[联盟客层级/类型]&#10;  G --&gt; J[品类/地区/新客]&#10;  H --&gt; K[费率快照 rate]&#10;  I --&gt; K&#10;  J --&gt; K&#10;  K --&gt; L[单笔佣金 commission]&#10;  L --&gt; M[结算期汇总]&#10;  M --&gt; N[阶梯奖金 bonus]&#10;  M --&gt; O[退货/拒付扣减]&#10;  N --&gt; P[应付金额]&#10;  O --&gt; P\">graph TD\n  A[订单事件] --&gt; B[确定计佣基数 base]\n  B --&gt; C{取哪些金额}\n  C --&gt; D[GMV 含运费]\n  C --&gt; E[净销售额 扣运费/税]\n  C --&gt; F[毛利口径]\n  B --&gt; G[解析费率上下文 context]\n  G --&gt; H[广告主程序]\n  G --&gt; I[联盟客层级/类型]\n  G --&gt; J[品类/地区/新客]\n  H --&gt; K[费率快照 rate]\n  I --&gt; K\n  J --&gt; K\n  K --&gt; L[单笔佣金 commission]\n  L --&gt; M[结算期汇总]\n  M --&gt; N[阶梯奖金 bonus]\n  M --&gt; O[退货/拒付扣减]\n  N --&gt; P[应付金额]\n  O --&gt; P</pre><p>请注意 <code>K</code> 这一层的名字：<strong>费率快照</strong>。费率必须在下单那一刻被冻结并写进佣金记录，而不是在结算时按当时的费率重新计算。原因在后面展开。</p>\n<h2 id=\"计佣基数的三种口径\">计佣基数的三种口径</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>口径</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n<th>商家成本</th>\n<th>联盟客接受度</th>\n<th>典型使用者</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>GMV</td>\n<td>订单成交总额（含运费、税前）</td>\n<td>最高</td>\n<td>最高</td>\n<td>起步期程序、媒体强势渠道</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>净销售额</td>\n<td>GMV − 运费 − 税 − 折扣券分摊</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>主流电商联盟</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>毛利口径</td>\n<td>净销售额 − 商品成本</td>\n<td>最低</td>\n<td>低（需要信任对方成本数据）</td>\n<td>高佣品类、批发</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>固定金额</td>\n<td>每单固定金额，与售价无关</td>\n<td>可预测</td>\n<td>低（低价商品相反）</td>\n<td>虚拟商品、订阅首单</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>毛利口径在实践中几乎不可行，因为它要求联盟客信任广告主的成本核算；但它作为<strong>内部决策口径</strong>是必要的——广告主应该用毛利口径判断&quot;这个费率我是否负担得起&quot;，再用净销售额口径去签约。这中间的差额就是渠道成本的真实水平。</p>\n<p><strong>折扣与优惠券的分摊</strong>是基数里最容易吵架的部分。如果一个订单用了商家自发的满减券，这笔券的金额应该从计佣基数中扣除吗？行业常见做法是：<strong>广告主自发的促销从基数中扣除，联盟客专属码带来的折扣不扣除</strong>（因为那是联盟客为促成交易所付出的成本）。这条规则必须在合同里写清楚，否则每次大促结算都会产生批量争议。</p>\n<h2 id=\"费率形态-固定-比例-阶梯-以及它们的组合\">费率形态：固定、比例、阶梯，以及它们的组合</h2><p><strong>固定佣金（flat / bounty）</strong> 每单固定金额。它对联盟客的价值随客单价上升而下降，因此只适合客单价低且稳定的品类（如虚拟商品、试用订阅）。它的最大优点是<strong>可预测</strong>——商家能准确算出每笔成交的渠道成本，联盟客也能准确估算收入。</p>\n<p><strong>比例佣金（percentage of sale）</strong> 按基数的一个百分比。它是电商联盟的默认形态，因为它的成本随售价自动伸缩。缺点是低价商品上佣金绝对额太小，激励不足；这通常通过<strong>最低佣金保底（floor）</strong> 来修补：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>commission</mtext><mo>=</mo><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>r</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>b</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{commission} = \\max(r \\cdot b, \\; f)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6679em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">commission</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<p><strong>阶梯佣金（tiered）</strong> 有两种截然不同的含义，混用会导致严重误解：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>阶梯类型</th>\n<th>阶梯变量</th>\n<th>作用</th>\n<th>风险</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>成交量阶梯（volume tier）</td>\n<td>结算期内的归因成交额/单量</td>\n<td>激励上量</td>\n<td>冲量作弊、月末集中刷单</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>订单金额阶梯（order tier）</td>\n<td>单笔订单金额</td>\n<td>激励推高客单</td>\n<td>拆单绕过</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>商品/品类阶梯</td>\n<td>商品所属类目</td>\n<td>引导推高毛利品类</td>\n<td>类目归属争议</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>新客阶梯</td>\n<td>是否首次购买</td>\n<td>激励拉新</td>\n<td>新客判定口径与账号合并</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>成交量阶梯的计算是<strong>回溯性（retroactive）</strong> 还是<strong>边际性（marginal）</strong> 必须明确：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>retroactive: </mtext><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mi>B</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>arg</mi><mo>⁡</mo><munder><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mi>i</mi></munder><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>≥</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{retroactive: } C = r_k \\cdot B, \\quad k = \\arg\\max_i \\{B \\ge T_i\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">retroactive: </span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5945em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.4777em;vertical-align:-0.7277em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">ar<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop\">max</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7277em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>marginal: </mtext><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></munder><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>  </mtext><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{marginal: } C = \\sum_i r_i \\cdot \\min(\\max(B - T_i, 0),\\; T_{i+1} - T_i)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">marginal: </span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3277em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>回溯性阶梯在跨越门槛时会产生<strong>断崖式跳变</strong>——多卖一元可能多拿几千元佣金，这直接制造了月末冲量的动机。边际阶梯更平滑，也更好解释，但联盟客算不清自己能拿多少。多数成熟程序采用<strong>回溯性但设上限</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>commission</mtext><mo>≤</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mtext>order value</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{commission} \\le c_{\\max} \\cdot \\text{order value}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8038em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">commission</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5945em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">order value</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>，用封顶把跳变限制在可控范围。</p>\n<h2 id=\"费率的多维定价与费率快照\">费率的多维定价与费率快照</h2><p>真实程序里费率是<strong>多维查表</strong>的结果，不是单一数字：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;rate_rule_id&quot;: &quot;rr_us_beauty_kol&quot;,&#10;  &quot;program_id&quot;: &quot;prog_us_main&quot;,&#10;  &quot;publisher_tier&quot;: &quot;gold&quot;,&#10;  &quot;publisher_type&quot;: &quot;creator&quot;,&#10;  &quot;category&quot;: &quot;beauty&quot;,&#10;  &quot;region&quot;: &quot;US&quot;,&#10;  &quot;customer_type&quot;: &quot;new&quot;,&#10;  &quot;base&quot;: &quot;net_sale&quot;,&#10;  &quot;rate&quot;: 0.18,&#10;  &quot;floor&quot;: 1.5,&#10;  &quot;cap_ratio&quot;: 0.35,&#10;  &quot;priority&quot;: 100,&#10;  &quot;effective_from&quot;: &quot;2026-07-01T00:00:00Z&quot;,&#10;  &quot;effective_to&quot;: &quot;2026-12-31T23:59:59Z&quot;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"rate_rule_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"rr_us_beauty_kol\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"program_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"prog_us_main\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"publisher_tier\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"gold\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"publisher_type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"creator\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"category\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"beauty\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"region\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"US\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"customer_type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"new\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"base\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"net_sale\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"rate\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.18</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"floor\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1.5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"cap_ratio\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.35</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"priority\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">100</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"effective_from\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-07-01T00:00:00Z\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"effective_to\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-12-31T23:59:59Z\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>解析规则是<strong>优先级 + 特异性</strong>：多条规则同时命中时，取 <code>priority</code> 最高者；优先级相同时取匹配维度更多者。这个解析必须确定性且可复现，否则同一个订单在不同时间算出不同佣金，对账会崩溃。</p>\n<p><strong>费率快照（rate snapshot）</strong> 是硬性要求。下单时把命中的 <code>rate_rule_id</code>、<code>rate</code>、<code>base</code> 三个字段写进佣金记录，此后无论规则如何变更，这笔订单的佣金都以快照为准。没有快照的系统会遇到一个经典故障：运营在月末调整了费率，历史订单在重算时全部变了数字，已经打款的联盟客账目全部对不上。代价是费率降档时旧订单仍按高费率结算——这个代价是可接受的，且可以通过&quot;新费率只对新点击生效&quot;进一步收紧。</p>\n<h2 id=\"阶梯奖金与扣减-周期维度\">阶梯奖金与扣减：周期维度</h2><p>阶梯奖金在结算期结束时统一计算，它不依赖单笔订单，而依赖<strong>周期汇总值</strong>：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[周期内归因订单] --&gt; B[汇总确认成交额]&#10;  B --&gt; C{达到阶梯?}&#10;  C --&gt;|否| D[无奖金 按基础费率]&#10;  C --&gt;|是| E[计算阶梯奖金]&#10;  E --&gt; F[叠加封顶检查]&#10;  F --&gt; G[周期应付]&#10;  H[周期内退货/拒付] --&gt; I[扣减项]&#10;  G --&gt; J[净应付 = 应付 - 扣减]&#10;  I --&gt; J&#10;  J --&gt; K{净应付 &lt; 0?}&#10;  K --&gt;|是| L[结转为下期负余额]&#10;  K --&gt;|否| M[发起付款]\">graph TD\n  A[周期内归因订单] --&gt; B[汇总确认成交额]\n  B --&gt; C{达到阶梯?}\n  C --&gt;|否| D[无奖金 按基础费率]\n  C --&gt;|是| E[计算阶梯奖金]\n  E --&gt; F[叠加封顶检查]\n  F --&gt; G[周期应付]\n  H[周期内退货/拒付] --&gt; I[扣减项]\n  G --&gt; J[净应付 = 应付 - 扣减]\n  I --&gt; J\n  J --&gt; K{净应付 &lt; 0?}\n  K --&gt;|是| L[结转为下期负余额]\n  K --&gt;|否| M[发起付款]</pre><p>扣减项至少包括四类：退货冲销、拒付（chargeback）分摊、无效流量扣回（反作弊判定的虚假成交）、以及某些市场的预扣税（withholding tax）。其中<strong>无效流量扣回</strong>最敏感：它在结算日才被告知，联盟客往往要求提供证据。因此反作弊结论必须附带可申诉的记录——见 <a href=\"../settlement-fraud/affiliate-fraud-detect\">自购作弊与虚假成交识别</a>。</p>\n<p>净应付为负时的处理是一个必须提前设计的决策：结转（carry forward）、向联盟客追偿、还是从保证金扣除。跨境场景下追偿成本往往高于金额本身，行业常见做法是在<strong>入驻时收取保证金或设置最低结算门槛</strong>，用制度代替追偿。</p>\n<h2 id=\"佣金池与抽成-网络拿走的那一块\">佣金池与抽成：网络拿走的那一块</h2><p>如果广告主通过联盟网络分发，广告主支付的佣金被网络抽成后才到联盟客手里。抽成方式通常有两种：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>抽成方式</th>\n<th>结构</th>\n<th>广告主感知</th>\n<th>联盟客感知</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>加价式</td>\n<td>广告主付 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span>，网络抽 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mord\">%</span></span></span></span></span>，联盟客得 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r(1-x)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>成本 = <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>收入打折，不透明</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>上浮式</td>\n<td>联盟客要 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span>，网络向广告主报 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r/(1-x)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>成本被抬高</td>\n<td>收入符合预期</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这两种在合同里可能写成同一句话，实际差别是&quot;谁承担网络的抽成&quot;。<strong>广告主必须能说清自己付的费率是税前还是含抽成</strong>，否则跨渠道的费率比较毫无意义。这也是 <a href=\"affiliate-vs-ad\">Affiliate 与站内广告/CPS 的区别</a> 里提到的&quot;两个渠道数字对不上&quot;的一个具体来源。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>佣金结构的第一步是定<strong>计佣基数</strong>，不是定费率；GMV / 净销售额 / 毛利三种口径下&quot;15%&quot;的含义相差数倍。</li>\n<li>费率是 <code>context</code> 的函数，需要多维查表 + 确定性优先级解析；解析结果必须在<strong>下单时快照</strong>，否则费率变更会污染历史账单。</li>\n<li>固定、比例、阶梯三种形态各有适用面；阶梯必须明确是<strong>回溯性</strong>还是<strong>边际性</strong>，回溯性阶梯要配封顶以抑制月末冲量。</li>\n<li>周期维度的阶梯奖金与扣减项（退货、拒付、无效流量、预扣税）独立于单笔订单，且必须支持负余额结转。</li>\n<li>通过网络分发时，抽成方式（加价 vs 上浮）决定谁承担成本，费率比较前必须统一口径。</li>\n<li>折扣分摊、最低保底、封顶比例、保证金门槛这四条&quot;边界条款&quot;，往往比费率数字本身更影响实际成本。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"佣金结构：固定、比例与阶梯","id":"佣金结构-固定-比例与阶梯"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：三层结构——基数、费率、形态","id":"核心概念-三层结构-基数-费率-形态"},{"level":2,"text":"计佣基数的三种口径","id":"计佣基数的三种口径"},{"level":2,"text":"费率形态：固定、比例、阶梯，以及它们的组合","id":"费率形态-固定-比例-阶梯-以及它们的组合"},{"level":2,"text":"费率的多维定价与费率快照","id":"费率的多维定价与费率快照"},{"level":2,"text":"阶梯奖金与扣减：周期维度","id":"阶梯奖金与扣减-周期维度"},{"level":2,"text":"佣金池与抽成：网络拿走的那一块","id":"佣金池与抽成-网络拿走的那一块"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"Affiliate 与站内广告、CPS 的区别","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/affiliate-partner-marketing/affiliate-model/affiliate-vs-ad"},"next":{"title":"推广链接与追踪参数的生成","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/affiliate-partner-marketing/tracking-attribution/affiliate-link-param"}}